"Where proprietary names may appear, decided 2026-11-20 after the MozAIk review. FIELD VALUES and identifiers are descriptive throughout: an order, a compensation, a rate, a family. No engine rule, and no user-facing string, ever matches on a product name. EVIDENCE fields - source, and the _note fields - do name the product and the author, because an attributed citation is how a reader checks a claim, and removing the attribution would be the plagiarism we are trying to avoid, not the cure for it. Long verbatim passages are paraphrased with the attribution kept. The reference implementation is HQPlayer, by Signalyst; its modulator names are listed once, in modulators.json _reference_names, for correspondence only."
